### Get all products
GET http://localhost:5192/api/products
### Create a product
POST http://localhost:5192/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "KB-002",
  "name": "Virtual Keyboard",
  "unitPrice": 4500.00,
  "quantityOnHand": 20,
  "lowStockThreshold": 5
}

### Get a product by id
GET http://localhost:5192/api/products/2